Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 4.1.31-rt35 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 4.1.31 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  branch: v4.1-rt
  Head SHA1: 57dad0b2f6693c01240772222c120516d5cd9d8a


Or to build 4.1.31-rt35 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v4.x/linux-4.1.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v4.x/patch-4.1.31.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/4.1/patch-4.1.31-rt35.patch.xz




Enjoy,

-- Steve

